---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contact - Pavel Kleisner">

    <section class="cta bleed" style="margin-top:0;padding-block:4rem 4.5rem">
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.4vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.4;color:var(--on-green);max-width:40rem;margin-top:1.4rem">Backend, integrations, a release to own or a production problem to untangle? Send a short email and I'll tell you plainly whether I can help.</p>
        <a class="email" href="mailto:contact@pavelkleisner.dev">contact@pavelkleisner.dev</a>
        <p>A few lines about the problem, the context and the expected scope are enough.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="margin-top:4rem">
        <div class="contact-grid">
            <div><h3>LinkedIn</h3><p>Professional background and experience.</p><p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pavel-kleisner-895989129/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/pavel-kleisner-895989129</a></p></div>
            <div><h3>GitHub</h3><p>Code and the source of this site.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/JohnyIII" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/JohnyIII</a></p></div>
            <div><h3>Working together</h3><p>Self-employed contractor, open to long-term and focused engagements, remotely from near Prague (CET). The best fit where backend behaviour, data, external contracts and releases all matter at once.</p></div>
        </div>
    </section>

</Layout>
